                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 11302/241.</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Minister Sherrill to
                        the Secretary of State.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Paraphrase.</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >American Legation</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Buenos
                                Aires</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1910-07-12"
                                ><hi rendition="#italic">July 12,
                    1910</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Mr. Sherrill reports that the Pan American conference opened this day at 4
                    o’clock in the afternoon.</p>
            </div>
